# Line endings are load-bearing here:
#
#  * crates/horizon-shader-api/tests/reference.rs compares docs/api/*-reference.md
#    byte-for-byte with what `horizon-shader doc` generates;
#  * `horizon-shader pack` embeds pack files verbatim, so a CRLF checkout would
#    produce different `.hshader` bytes than the same pack on Linux/macOS;
#  * crates/horizon-shader-gallery compares golden frames and pack textures as
#    raw bytes.
#
# So every text file is checked out with LF on every OS, including Git for
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images are hashed and compared byte-for-byte (golden frames, pack textures).
*.png binary

# Ship-format archives are built byte-for-byte reproducibly; never convert.
*.hshader binary
